WEBVTT

00:03.740 --> 00:06.310
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.490 --> 00:10.420
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.430 --> 00:14.020
What he is?

00:14.210 --> 00:18.600
What he wants?

00:22.270 --> 00:29.680
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.680 --> 00:34.750
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:37.030 --> 00:44.010
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.430 --> 00:51.880
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.680 --> 00:57.170
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.390 --> 01:00.680
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:01.030 --> 01:04.530
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.750 --> 01:08.110
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.410 --> 01:11.940
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:12.140 --> 01:15.490
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.810 --> 01:19.330
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:19.330 --> 01:24.240
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:31.080 --> 01:35.660
Franken

01:36.970 --> 01:41.810
Driving, driving...

01:49.770 --> 01:52.750
The model is old,
but the parts are good parts.

01:52.750 --> 01:55.560
La, la, la...

01:58.680 --> 02:01.840
Again, I heard it.

02:01.980 --> 02:03.800
Don't be a chicken.

02:03.800 --> 02:07.970
All the main parts and lines
are taken out from these.

02:08.030 --> 02:13.070
Driving, driving...

02:16.200 --> 02:20.460
For some reason it started
with leftover energy.

02:54.030 --> 02:57.600
Driving, driving...

03:56.970 --> 04:00.980
Older students will take care
of younger students, okay?

04:01.080 --> 04:05.870
Younger students should listen
to the older students...

04:05.870 --> 04:08.640
...so you don't get lost, okay?

04:08.640 --> 04:10.790
What do you want to ride first?

04:10.790 --> 04:12.230
Magic Train!

04:12.230 --> 04:14.090
Of course, the roller coaster!

04:14.090 --> 04:16.210
Merry- go- round!

04:16.900 --> 04:19.860
No! No running!

04:27.670 --> 04:29.970
Atom!

05:15.630 --> 05:16.760
What?

05:27.570 --> 05:30.400
Your name is Taku Fujimoto.
Are you in the second grade?

05:30.400 --> 05:31.690
Yes.

05:31.840 --> 05:35.080
What do you want to ride?
I will ride with you.

05:35.080 --> 05:37.150
I don't want to ride anything.

05:37.360 --> 05:41.350
So do you want to eat something,
ice cream or crepes?

05:41.450 --> 05:43.140
I don't want to eat.

05:45.180 --> 05:47.710
It's such a wonderful field trip.

05:47.950 --> 05:51.520
He is gone and didn't say
anything to me.

05:51.830 --> 05:53.930
We were such close friends!

05:54.000 --> 05:55.540
Who?

06:06.240 --> 06:07.480
Everybody.

06:07.680 --> 06:11.680
Do you know why
Taku is not in a good mood?

06:14.020 --> 06:16.790
His robot friend is gone.

06:16.790 --> 06:19.820
It may be stolen.
That's what my dad told me.

06:19.820 --> 06:22.460
There have been many incidents
like that lately.

06:22.460 --> 06:24.470
There are some bad people
who take them apart...

06:24.470 --> 06:27.850
...and sell the parts for money.

06:30.130 --> 06:33.160
So maybe they took Taku's robot too.

06:34.070 --> 06:36.200
La, la, la.

06:36.940 --> 06:41.380
Driving, driving...

06:42.310 --> 06:45.480
Al, where are you?

07:40.340 --> 07:44.220
Dr. Ochanomizu, it's an emergency!

07:44.440 --> 07:47.710
Sector 236, unknown object
is raging about!

07:47.740 --> 07:49.520
Urgent, please identify what it is!

07:49.610 --> 07:52.830
Please refer to the robot manual!

07:52.970 --> 07:55.030
We haven't seen such an object!

08:00.920 --> 08:02.560
What is this?

08:02.660 --> 08:06.030
This is a patchwork of different robots.

08:06.530 --> 08:10.000
Access the main computer
in the robot control center.

08:10.000 --> 08:11.000
Yes, sir!

08:11.070 --> 08:15.790
From this screen, production date.
Please calculate the registered number!

08:15.790 --> 08:16.970
Yes, sir.

08:29.220 --> 08:31.770
He is getting bigger.

08:32.020 --> 08:34.400
He is putting everything
into his stomach...

08:34.400 --> 08:36.470
...and growing bigger and bigger!

08:51.140 --> 08:54.270
The robot is heading towards
an amusement park!

08:54.300 --> 08:55.450
What?

09:08.240 --> 09:10.660
Ladies and gentlemen,

09:10.760 --> 09:13.180
This is Metro City Police.

09:13.240 --> 09:16.600
This is an emergency!
Please evacuate immediately!

09:16.700 --> 09:19.110
This is Metro City Police!

09:19.130 --> 09:20.030
Please evacuate immediately!

09:20.090 --> 09:22.040
Hurry up, everybody.

09:22.040 --> 09:23.730
Please evacuate immediately!

09:34.320 --> 09:37.120
Hurry up, everyone!

09:44.830 --> 09:46.520
Everybody, get on the bus.

09:49.930 --> 09:51.980
What's going on, Atom?

09:53.270 --> 09:54.770
Missing one.

09:55.270 --> 09:56.450
Taku!

10:13.060 --> 10:14.580
Master.

10:28.380 --> 10:30.470
Stop, stop!

10:30.650 --> 10:32.870
Right now, quick! Get in the bus.

10:40.680 --> 10:43.340
Let's go, Taku! Run quickly.

10:45.500 --> 10:46.810
Atom!

10:54.610 --> 10:55.990
You did it!

11:00.800 --> 11:03.580
Who are you?
What are you doing?

11:18.580 --> 11:20.010
Detective Tawashi!

11:21.450 --> 11:23.790
We are ready to fight the robot!

11:23.860 --> 11:25.820
Wait! Wait a minute!

11:27.060 --> 11:27.880
It is!

11:28.600 --> 11:30.160
It's Atom!

11:31.610 --> 11:34.290
I am Atom!
What is your name?

11:57.760 --> 11:59.050
Dr. Ochanomizu!

11:59.530 --> 12:03.360
Received a reply from the control center!
Switch to the main monitor.

12:04.930 --> 12:07.270
Production dates
and the serial numbers.

12:08.100 --> 12:10.590
As of now, there are 68 bodies.

12:10.610 --> 12:14.170
It's made of 68 robots.

12:15.080 --> 12:19.170
As far as I can see in this data,
they are all old robots.

12:19.750 --> 12:23.580
Most of them are robots
with search warrants.

12:23.620 --> 12:25.930
Does this mean...?

12:26.450 --> 12:29.930
They were probably stolen
by robot dealers.

12:29.930 --> 12:33.670
It must be black-market scrappers
who steal valuable robot parts...

12:33.730 --> 12:37.330
...and trash the rest.

12:37.500 --> 12:40.830
Yes, it must be made up
of a bunch of wreckage.

12:48.890 --> 12:52.570
We must find out who this robot is.

12:52.570 --> 12:53.530
Yes, sir.

12:59.390 --> 13:00.670
It disappeared!

13:00.790 --> 13:03.770
He disappeared into the ground.

13:20.510 --> 13:22.880
Driving, driving

13:26.580 --> 13:27.740
Detective!

13:30.550 --> 13:32.740
Atom!
What happened to Atom?

13:33.290 --> 13:38.150
He fell into the mine that was closed
a long time ago with the monster.

13:38.760 --> 13:41.590
They're at the bottom of Tate Mine.
It's 1 50 meters deep.

13:41.600 --> 13:42.830
What?

13:43.230 --> 13:48.030
The earth is loose there...
so it may cave in if you go near it.

13:48.360 --> 13:49.700
What about Atom?

13:49.730 --> 13:51.640
His situation is unknown.

13:51.750 --> 13:55.300
We can only wait till
he shows up.

14:08.820 --> 14:11.510
Are you okay?

14:11.690 --> 14:15.220
I want to....

14:15.330 --> 14:16.260
What?

14:16.610 --> 14:20.710
I want to see Master.

14:26.870 --> 14:28.690
Master.

14:28.910 --> 14:33.820
This is an image of your
memory circuit, isn't it?

14:33.880 --> 14:38.780
La, la, la!
Driving, driving!

14:38.830 --> 14:40.150
That boy is...

14:40.680 --> 14:42.120
Taku!

14:44.060 --> 14:49.500
Driving, driving

14:51.340 --> 14:53.380
Dr. Ochanomizu! Doctor!

14:53.440 --> 14:57.380
We figured out the main
serial number of that robot.

14:57.470 --> 14:58.610
What?

15:04.580 --> 15:07.170
QF65- 1 77...

15:07.220 --> 15:10.620
...a robot manufactured
to drive a car.

15:10.690 --> 15:11.980
Check it out right away.

15:11.980 --> 15:12.890
Yes, sir.

15:15.890 --> 15:20.440
Driving, driving...

15:20.500 --> 15:24.410
I see! You are Taku's best friend.

15:24.570 --> 15:26.500
Al.

15:27.040 --> 15:29.810
Al. Is that your name?

15:30.840 --> 15:31.770
Al.

15:32.510 --> 15:37.340
He was called Al, and he was working
in the same house over 1 0 years.

15:37.610 --> 15:40.430
Based on the investigation,
Al was helping an only child:

15:40.500 --> 15:44.250
7-year-old Taku Fujimoto.
He was not only driving him to school

15:44.390 --> 15:47.010
but also taking care
of his daily chores.

15:47.890 --> 15:52.770
It seems that his parents...
depended on Al to take care of the boy.

15:59.730 --> 16:01.250
Master!

16:05.130 --> 16:07.460
Master!

16:07.510 --> 16:12.110
Pain, pain go away...

16:12.620 --> 16:15.910
Pain, pain go away...

16:15.980 --> 16:19.240
Al, that's a funny song!

16:19.300 --> 16:20.530
Pain, pain go away!

16:20.590 --> 16:22.320
Stop it.

16:22.580 --> 16:26.620
Pain, pain go away!

16:27.230 --> 16:32.360
And there is a burglary report
filed by the parents.

16:32.700 --> 16:35.010
It must be a black-market scrapper.
That's likely.

16:35.410 --> 16:38.020
They kidnapped Al,
took out some parts...

16:38.110 --> 16:41.900
...dismantled it and threw it away.

16:43.280 --> 16:46.480
For some odd reason,
he became alive.

16:47.370 --> 16:51.180
Then it must be that
the self- control circuit is broken.

16:52.500 --> 16:53.840
Detective Tawashi...

16:54.520 --> 16:58.150
...there is always a reason
for robot problems.

16:58.430 --> 17:00.620
Al is not an exception.

17:01.000 --> 17:03.350
He is a victim!

17:04.130 --> 17:06.890
Are you telling us to give him a break?

17:07.270 --> 17:08.560
Are you kidding?

17:08.580 --> 17:13.370
This monster attacked cars.. hurt people
at the dam construction site...

17:13.390 --> 17:15.100
...and destroyed the amusement park!

17:15.150 --> 17:19.140
He has to pay for it, no matter what.

17:19.210 --> 17:21.210
But Detective Tawashi....

17:32.160 --> 17:34.450
I have to let the doctor
know about this.

17:44.170 --> 17:50.180
Friends are always together.

17:50.970 --> 17:53.640
Stop, Al!

18:12.670 --> 18:15.180
Detective, he is out of the cave!

18:18.810 --> 18:21.400
Emergency! Emergency!

18:22.010 --> 18:24.540
He is moving towards Metro City!

18:24.680 --> 18:27.750
Metro City, attack positions
immediately! Order full attack!

18:29.480 --> 18:33.130
Wait a minute, detective!
Atom is with him!

18:33.150 --> 18:34.860
I have no choice!

18:34.890 --> 18:38.330
I have a responsibility
to protect the people!

18:38.480 --> 18:39.770
Detective....

18:54.870 --> 18:56.960
Target. Got it!

18:57.010 --> 18:58.420
Fire!

19:07.610 --> 19:10.960
Master.

19:26.760 --> 19:30.140
Master.

19:30.900 --> 19:34.110
Danger, danger!
Evacuate immediately!

19:34.320 --> 19:37.720
Danger, danger!
Evacuate immediately!

19:42.660 --> 19:46.760
Master!

19:47.230 --> 19:48.280
Al?

19:54.440 --> 19:57.780
Please don't shoot.
Al just came to see Taku.

20:05.880 --> 20:07.250
Al!

20:08.110 --> 20:09.680
Al!

20:16.160 --> 20:18.040
Master.

20:19.090 --> 20:20.220
Al?

20:26.800 --> 20:28.720
Don't shoot!

20:42.550 --> 20:45.490
Master.

20:49.430 --> 20:51.620
Don't shoot! There is a boy!

20:55.070 --> 20:56.340
Watch out!

20:58.830 --> 21:01.710
Master!

21:07.270 --> 21:13.310
Pain, pain go away!

21:13.330 --> 21:14.170
Al!

21:14.170 --> 21:15.530
Master!

21:15.530 --> 21:16.490
Al!

21:16.490 --> 21:18.420
Master!

21:18.420 --> 21:21.230
Where were you, Al?

21:21.510 --> 21:25.570
Pain, pain go away...

21:26.560 --> 21:31.260
Though the robot was torn apart
there was a piece of its heart left.

21:31.700 --> 21:35.010
End operation. Everyone, withdraw.

21:35.580 --> 21:38.210
Let me ask the Ministry of Science
to fix it.

21:38.270 --> 21:39.870
Really, doctor?

21:39.870 --> 21:41.030
Yes.

21:42.500 --> 21:44.090
Thank goodness.

21:47.850 --> 21:51.820
Driving, driving
La, la, la.

21:51.870 --> 21:55.980
Always driving
La, la, la.

21:56.760 --> 22:03.820
How long does it go.

22:12.440 --> 22:17.970
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:18.370 --> 22:23.580
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.960 --> 22:29.470
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:29.750 --> 22:35.050
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:35.410 --> 22:40.690
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:41.170 --> 22:49.330
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:49.730 --> 22:52.610
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.820 --> 23:00.820
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:01.410 --> 23:03.820
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:04.250 --> 23:12.530
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.830 --> 23:17.560
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:24.410 --> 23:28.470
Space- exploration robots
suddenly attack Metro City!

23:28.620 --> 23:31.980
Who is deceiving them?
Dr. Tenma!

23:32.400 --> 23:35.320
Next time:
Venus Robot.

23:35.380 --> 23:38.100
With your heart, catch the future!
